cases.narrative:
)n 8/21/1996, she was abducted from her driveway. 

She was seen in her driveway at around 9:30 a.m. that morning and seen entering a box-type vehicle with an unidentified male but wasn't seen for the remainder of August 21st. Her father initially believed that she was with her mother camping, but by evening had become concerned that she had been kidnapped.

In 2017, Moline police said a witness saw Trudy with Smith in a silver Chevrolet near his residence on Campbell's Island on Aug. 21, 1996. Police believe Smith took her boating before she disappeared. They believe he abducted and strangled her because of a drug debt owed by her father.
